  },
  {
   "id": "19IRE92:193",
   "ptr": "0x193",
   "len": 34,
   "jp": "「ソーホゥの村のことは聞いたよ。\\n",
   "en": "\"I heard about Sohou Village. I was in Balkrutha when the second Wave hit.",
   "max": 34,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "ゲーツ\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "19IRE92:1b8",
   "ptr": "0x1b8",
   "len": 22,
   "jp": "　２度目の波動の時、\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 22,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 19IRE92:193"
  },
  {
   "id": "19IRE92:1d1",
   "ptr": "0x1d1",
   "len": 34,
   "jp": "　おれはバルクルーサにいたのさ。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 34,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "　２度目の波動の時、\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 19IRE92:193"
  },
  {
   "id": "19IRE92:1f7",
   "ptr": "0x1f7",
   "len": 14,
   "jp": "　おかげで、\\n",
   "en": "So I'm the only one who made it...",
   "max": 14,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "19IRE92:208",
   "ptr": "0x208",
   "len": 34,
   "jp": "　おれだけ生き残っちまった・・・\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 34,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "　おかげで、\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 19IRE92:1f7"
  },
  {
   "id": "19IRE92:22e",
   "ptr": "0x22e",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　別に、移民たちがどうのなんて、恨ん\\n",
   "en": "Don't get me wrong, I ain't got a grudge against the settlers or nothin'. This is just kinda our fate...",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "19IRE92:257",
   "ptr": "0x257",
   "len": 18,
   "jp": "　じゃいないぜ。\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 18,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 19IRE92:22e"
  },
  {
   "id": "19IRE92:26c",
   "ptr": "0x26c",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　これが、おれたちの運命みたいなもの\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "　じゃいないぜ。\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 19IRE92:22e"
  },
  {
   "id": "19IRE92:295",
   "ptr": "0x295",
   "len": 18,
   "jp": "　だからな・・・\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 18,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 19IRE92:22e"
  },
  {
   "id": "19IRE92:2ab",
   "ptr": "0x2ab",
   "len": 30,
   "jp": "　だけど、もし、あれを・・・\\n",
   "en": "But if you two... can do somethin' about that... about the Black Dragon.........",
   "max": 30,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "19IRE92:2cc",
   "ptr": "0x2cc",
   "len": 16,
   "jp": "　黒竜を・・・\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 16,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "　だけど、もし、あれを・・・\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 19IRE92:2ab"
  },
  {
   "id": "19IRE92:2df",
   "ptr": "0x2df",
   "len": 32,
   "jp": "　あんたたちが何とかできるって\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 32,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "　黒竜を・・・\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 19IRE92:2ab"
  },
  {
   "id": "19IRE92:302",
   "ptr": "0x302",
   "len": 30,
   "jp": "　いうなら・・・・・・・・・\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 30,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 19IRE92:2ab"
  },
  {
   "id": "19IRE92:324",
   "ptr": "0x324",
   "len": 40,
   "jp": "　貴族の船の残骸は、この先の入り江だ。\\n",
   "en": "The wreck of the nobles' ship is in the cove up ahead. I left the door unlocked for ya.\"",
   "max": 40,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "19IRE92:34f",
   "ptr": "0x34f",
   "len": 30,
   "jp": "　ドアの鍵は開けておいたぜ」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 30,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 19IRE92:324"
  },
  {
   "id": "19IRE92:383",
   "ptr": "0x383",
   "len": 8,
   "jp": "ゲーツ\\n",
   "en": "Goetz",
   "max": 8,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "19IRE92:38e",
   "ptr": "0x38e",
   "len": 32,
   "jp": "「昔から海に投げ出された物は、\\n",
   "en": "\"Since way back, everything lost at sea rides the tide and washes up in this cove.",
   "max": 32,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "ゲーツ\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "19IRE92:3b1",
   "ptr": "0x3b1",
   "len": 30,
   "jp": "　潮の流れに乗って、みんな、\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 30,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 19IRE92:38e"
  },
  {
   "id": "19IRE92:3d2",
   "ptr": "0x3d2",
   "len": 26,
   "jp": "　この入り江に流れ着く。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 26,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "　潮の流れに乗って、みんな、\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 19IRE92:38e"
  },
  {
   "id": "19IRE92:3f0",
   "ptr": "0x3f0",
   "len": 24,
   "jp": "　もちろん、死体もだ。\\f",
   "en": "Bodies too, of course.",
   "max": 24,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "19IRE92:40c",
   "ptr": "0x40c",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "　そんな怨念が積み重なったせいか、\\n",
   "en": "Maybe it's all those grudges piling up, but in the cove you hear the whispers of the dead, and they torment whoever goes there...",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "19IRE92:433",
   "ptr": "0x433",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　入り江では死者のささやきが聞こえ、\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 19IRE92:40c"
  },
  {
   "id": "19IRE92:45c",
   "ptr": "0x45c",
   "len": 26,
   "jp": "　行く者を悩ませる・・・\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 26,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 19IRE92:40c"
  },
  {
   "id": "19IRE92:47a",
   "ptr": "0x47a",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　慣れない奴は、気が変になっちまう程\\n",
   "en": "Folks who ain't used to it can lose their minds. That's why we never let outsiders in here.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "19IRE92:4a3",
   "ptr": "0x4a3",
   "len": 8,
   "jp": "　だ。\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 8,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 19IRE92:47a"
  },
  {
   "id": "19IRE92:4ae",
   "ptr": "0x4ae",
   "len": 40,
   "jp": "　だから、ここにはにヨソ者を入れなかっ\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 40,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "　だ。\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 19IRE92:47a"
  },
  {
   "id": "19IRE92:4d9",
   "ptr": "0x4d9",
   "len": 12,
   "jp": "　たのさ。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 12,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 19IRE92:47a"
  },
  {
   "id": "19IRE92:4e9",
   "ptr": "0x4e9",
   "len": 10,
   "jp": "　まあ、\\n",
   "en": "Well, you two'll probably be fine. Watch yourselves out there.\"",
   "max": 10,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "19IRE92:4f6",
   "ptr": "0x4f6",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　あんたたちなら大丈夫だろうけどね。\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "　まあ、\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 19IRE92:4e9"
  },
  {
   "id": "19IRE92:51f",
   "ptr": "0x51f",
   "len": 24,
   "jp": "　気をつけて行きなよ」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 24,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 19IRE92:4e9"
  },
